[{"userId":"uid_1777258014164_jne20y1xf","bookId":6,"threadKey":"char:260da40d-b9c3-4ff7-8cba-ac3f1d63b471","wid":"st_1791036115555_piwfif","role":"user","text":"考考我这一章吧，一次问一题。","charId":"260da40d-b9c3-4ff7-8cba-ac3f1d63b471","drill":true,"timestamp":1791036115555,"_id":1},{"userId":"uid_1777258014164_jne20y1xf","bookId":6,"threadKey":"char:260da40d-b9c3-4ff7-8cba-ac3f1d63b471","wid":"st_1791036127173_i933zc","role":"assistant","text":"秋煜姐，那我们按规矩来，一次一题，你慢慢答就好。\n\n第一题先看核心词 **assume**：除了大家最熟悉的“假定、设想”之外，在考研真题里它要是跟 responsibility（责任）或者 power（权力）搭配，通常是什么意思？","charId":"260da40d-b9c3-4ff7-8cba-ac3f1d63b471","timestamp":1791036127173,"_id":2},{"userId":"uid_1777258014164_jne20y1xf","bookId":6,"threadKey":"char:260da40d-b9c3-4ff7-8cba-ac3f1d63b471","wid":"st_1791036167977_uhhqhv","role":"user","text":"承担，支配","charId":"260da40d-b9c3-4ff7-8cba-ac3f1d63b471","drill":true,"timestamp":1791036167977,"_id":3},{"userId":"uid_1777258014164_jne20y1xf","bookId":6,"threadKey":"char:260da40d-b9c3-4ff7-8cba-ac3f1d63b471","wid":"st_1791036175039_uvt86l","role":"assistant","text":"回答得完全正确，搭配责任就是“承担”，搭配权力就是“掌管、掌握”。\n\n第二题：真题长难句里很喜欢出现的 **counterpart**，它的核心中文含义是什么？通常指代什么样的对象？","charId":"260da40d-b9c3-4ff7-8cba-ac3f1d63b471","timestamp":1791036175039,"_id":4},{"userId":"uid_1777258014164_jne20y1xf","bookId":6,"threadKey":"char:260da40d-b9c3-4ff7-8cba-ac3f1d63b471","wid":"st_1791036457414_2wcrpa","role":"user","text":"宫廷守卫","charId":"260da40d-b9c3-4ff7-8cba-ac3f1d63b471","drill":true,"timestamp":1791036457414,"_id":5},{"userId":"uid_1777258014164_jne20y1xf","bookId":6,"threadKey":"char:260da40d-b9c3-4ff7-8cba-ac3f1d63b471","wid":"st_1791036464646_njovtj","role":"assistant","text":"不对哦，秋煜姐。\n\n**counterpart** 的核心意思是“**对应的人或物**”，指在功能、地位、职位上与另一方相当的人或事物（比如两国外交会晤时，对方的同级别职务者就是 your counterpart）。\n\n第三题：在社会制度或法律类阅读文本中经常出现的 **precedent**，作名词时是什么意思？","charId":"260da40d-b9c3-4ff7-8cba-ac3f1d63b471","timestamp":1791036464646,"_id":6}]